# Flutter Booking System — Cursor Rules

## Architecture
Feature-based clean architecture: ApiClient → ApiService → RepositoryImpl → Provider → Screen

## Stack
- UI: Flutter + Material 3
- State: Provider (ChangeNotifier) only — no Riverpod, Bloc, GetX
- HTTP: core/network/api_client.dart wrapping `http`
- Config: flutter_dotenv + .env

## Folder structure
lib/
  main.dart
  core/
    constants/
    theme/
    widgets/
    error/app_exception.dart
    network/api_client.dart
  features/<feature>/
    domain/entities/
    domain/repositories/     ← abstract class only
    data/models/             ← fromJson/toJson
    data/services/           ← HTTP calls
    data/repositories/       ← *RepositoryImpl
    providers/
    screens/
    widgets/

## Layer rules
- Screens: never call HTTP, ApiClient, or *ApiService
- Providers: never parse JSON, never import data/; take abstract repository in constructor
- ApiService: HTTP + JSON → Model only; no notifyListeners
- RepositoryImpl: call service, return entities
- ApiClient: shared headers, status codes, network errors only
- main.dart wires everything: ApiClient → *ApiService → *RepositoryImpl → *Provider

## Naming
- Entity:   booking.dart         → Booking
- Model:    booking_model.dart   → BookingModel
- Service:  booking_api_service.dart → BookingApiService
- Contract: booking_repository.dart  → abstract class BookingRepository
- Impl:     booking_repository_impl.dart → BookingRepositoryImpl
- Provider: booking_provider.dart
- Files: snake_case | Classes: PascalCase | Private: _prefix

## Provider pattern
```dart
class BookingProvider extends ChangeNotifier {
  BookingProvider({required BookingRepository bookingRepository})
      : _bookingRepository = bookingRepository;

  final BookingRepository _bookingRepository;
  bool _isLoading = false;
  String? _error;
  List<Booking> _bookings = [];

  bool get isLoading => _isLoading;
  String? get error => _error;
  List<Booking> get bookings => _bookings;

  Future<void> fetchBookings() async {
    _isLoading = true;
    _error = null;
    notifyListeners();
    try {
      _bookings = await _bookingRepository.getBookings();
    } catch (e) {
      _error = e.toString();
    } finally {
      _isLoading = false;
      notifyListeners();
    }
  }
}
```

## Screens must handle 4 states
loading | error | empty | data

## Imports
- Same feature: relative paths
- Provider → domain/ only
- Widgets → domain/entities/ only
- Service → ApiClient + models
- Never import one feature from another

## Do NOT
- Merge ApiService and Repository
- Construct ApiClient/*ApiService inside a Provider
- Call APIs from widgets
- Hardcode URLs, colors, or strings
- Import data/ from screens
- Commit .env
- Use context.watch in onPressed

## Secrets
- API_BASE_URL in .env
- .env listed in pubspec.yaml assets
- .env in .gitignore
